{"step_index":526,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-20T17:07:53Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Walkthrough updated with the fixes for user name synchronization across SMS templates, and mobile Safari cross-platform contact and list deletion.","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"# Walkthrough: Fixes for User Name Synchronization & Contact Deletion\n\nThe **SnapDialer** app at [`C:\\Users\\brorm\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\snap-dialer`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer) has been updated and recompiled with the following fixes:\n\n---\n\n## 1. User Name Synchronization Across All SMS Messages\n- **What was fixed:**\n  - `AiSmsService.generatePersuasiveSMS` and `AiSmsService.getFallbackSMS` now dynamically pull your `user_name` from local settings and inject it into both Gemini AI prompts and fallback templates.\n  - In `SettingsScreen.tsx`, updating your name immediately updates the local database and displays an inline confirmation banner.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Cross-Platform Contact & List Deletion\n- **What was fixed:**\n  - Added full SQL delete query handlers to `WebDatabase` for `DELETE FROM leads WHERE id = ?`.\n  - Replaced browser-incompatible `Alert.alert` buttons with cross-platform confirmation dialogs (`window.confirm` on web/mobile Safari and native alerts on iOS/Android).\n  - Tapping **Delete Contact** on a lead profile or **Delete List** on the lists screen now removes entries instantly.\n\n---\n\n## 3. How to Deploy the Updated Build to Your iPhone:\nRun the following in your terminal to push the update to your live Surge link:\n```cmd\nnpx surge ./dist valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh\n```\n*(Replace `valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh` with your exact Surge domain if different).*\n","Description":"Walkthrough documenting fixes for name sync and contact deletion","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\brorm\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\9c9b5ef4-82a1-483f-9e9e-cb421c9396b3\\walkthrough.md","toolAction":"Updating walkthrough for name sync and contact deletion fixes","toolSummary":"Update walkthrough.md with bug fixes"}}]}
